      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fish Audio Drama 3 · text to speech (no voice)\n\n**Files**\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| drama3_fp8experts_bf16.safetensors (38.6 GB, the original FP8 experts)<br>or drama3_int8experts_bf16.safetensors (38.7 GB, faster on cards under 24 GB)<br>or drama3_w6a8experts_bf16.safetensors (32.7 GB)<br>or drama3_w4a8experts_bf16.safetensors (24.6 GB, falls silent more often) | models/diffusion_models |\n| drama3_codec.safetensors | models/vae |\n\nDownload them from [Drama-3-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Drama-3-ComfyUI).\n\n**How to use:** write your text in **Drama 3 Generate**; cues such as [sighs], [laughs] or [whispers] go where the sound should be. Without a voice the model invents one, a different one for each seed.\n\n**Good to know:** without a voice the model often makes a short sound and then falls silent; the generator stops such a take, cuts the silence and prints a warning in the console. Queue again for a new seed. Temperature 1.0, top_p 0.9 and top_k 0 (no cap) are the defaults of Fish Audio's Drama 3 Space; top_k 30 and lower values stall more often. For a voice you can keep, use the **Drama3 voice clone** workflow.\n\n**Speed:** experts in RAM, about 20-25 ms per frame on an RTX 3090 or 4090 (46 ms is real time); the first run also loads the file."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Fish Audio Drama 3 · text to speech (no voice)\n\n**Files**\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| drama3_fp8experts_bf16.safetensors (38.6 GB, the original FP8 experts)<br>or drama3_int8experts_bf16.safetensors (38.7 GB, faster on cards under 24 GB)<br>or drama3_w6a8experts_bf16.safetensors (32.7 GB)<br>or drama3_w4a8experts_bf16.safetensors (24.6 GB, falls silent more often) | models/diffusion_models |\n| drama3_codec.safetensors | models/vae |\n\nDownload them from [Drama-3-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Drama-3-ComfyUI).\n\n**How to use:** write your text in **Drama 3 Generate**; cues such as [sighs], [laughs] or [whispers] go where the sound should be. Without a voice the model invents one, a different one for each seed.\n\n**Good to know:** without a voice the model often makes a short sound and then falls silent; the generator stops such a take, cuts the silence and prints a warning in the console. Queue again for a new seed. Temperature 1.0, top_p 0.9 and top_k 0 (no cap) are the defaults of Fish Audio's Drama 3 Space; top_k 30 and lower values stall more often. For a voice you can keep, use the **Drama3 voice clone** workflow.\n\n**Speed:** experts in RAM, about 20-25 ms per frame on an RTX 3090 or 4090 (46 ms is real time); the first run also loads the file."
      },
